1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Two cyber scams every student should know.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Your dream internship promises great pay, but demands a registration fee. That's a warning sign.

3
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Another caller claims to be police. They threaten a so-called digital arrest and demand your details. An official-looking call alone proves nothing.

4
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:39,000
Scammers use pressure. Never share OTPs or passwords. Always verify through official sources.

5
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Report suspected cybercrime at cybercrime.gov.in. For financial cyber fraud, call 1930 promptly.

6
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:55,000
Take a moment. Verify before you trust.
